{"data": [{"article": {"title": "缠论入门：散户唯一值得学的技术分析框架 "}, "author_id": "2098305275229081600", "created_at": "2026-11-04T06:20:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117864622204318181"], "id": "2117864622204318181", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 294, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "炒美股可以用么？ https://t.co/9Nv08cv4h8", "url": "https://x.com/Dlife2026/status/2117864622204318181"}, {"author_id": "1869444322451746816", "created_at": "2026-11-03T04:10:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117469503282192751"], "id": "2117469503282192751", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 44, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "关注 @CaptainLufei999 路飞有一阵了，想认真说说为什么。\n\n第一，他自己造了一条船。 https://t.co/fb7NuR8xfW", "url": "https://x.com/zhngwijn3312799/status/2117469503282192751"}, {"author_id": "1916622377414475776", "created_at": "2026-11-04T07:52:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117887692042338561"], "id": "2117887692042338561", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 645, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117162391431749832", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "📈 金融交易的魔力②：预测的幻觉\n\n炒股很多年以后，我发现一个特别有意思的现象：\n\n几乎所有已经走完的股票行情，都有人能给你解释得明明白白。\n\n一个技术派打开MACD、均线，告诉你哪里是金叉，哪里是死叉。\n\n一个波浪理论高手，能画出完整的五浪结构。\n\n一个缠论大师，能找到中枢、背驰和买卖点。 https://t.co/8aqHutM7jE https://t.co/iob1Hlmo7L", "url": "https://x.com/ChinaTaxTruth/status/2117887692042338561"}, {"author_id": "166248328", "created_at": "2026-11-03T14:53:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117631380385607936"], "id": "2117631380385607936", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 12057, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "🤩🤗🥰\n【po文+po18+废文+AO3】合集\n\n🔗：\nhttps://t.co/d99hZMIxIT\n\n《安置》作者:今天也不要脱发\n《独独有睛天》作者:鸦鸦吃素也吃肉\n《多情应照我》作者:符黎\n《附送折磨》作者:鲈鱼酒柜\n《关山月》作者:花卷\n《海豚兄弟会》作者:bcjam.\n《海中月》作者:funny2333", "url": "https://x.com/kirstypop2/status/2117631380385607936"}, {"author_id": "1044779924819591168", "created_at": "2026-11-03T03:39:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117461514584273356"], "id": "2117461514584273356", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1001, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "汉哀帝刘欣二十岁登基，最宠的是个叫董贤的郎官。\n有天午睡，董贤压住了他的衣袖，他宁可用刀把袖子割断，也不忍叫醒他，\"断袖\" 这个词，就是这么来的。", "url": "https://x.com/wudawei8848/status/2117461514584273356"}, {"author_id": "1207132508040523776", "created_at": "2026-11-03T15:22:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117638513730433533", "2117638919126921653"], "id": "2117638513730433533", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 243, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "查尔斯让位了\n他在禅位诏书中说，二阿哥凯恩人品贵重，深肖朕躬，必能克承大统，著继朕登基即王位，即遵典制持服，是为凯恩一世，钦此 https://t.co/XCFGaO22AF", "url": "https://x.com/yuashwe/status/2117638513730433533"}, {"author_id": "1207132508040523776", "created_at": "2026-11-03T15:23:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117638513730433533", "2117638919126921653"], "id": "2117638919126921653", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4983, "like_count": 24, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 11, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "查尔斯三世让位了\n他在禅位诏书中说，二阿哥凯恩人品贵重，深肖朕躬，必能克承大统，著继朕登基即王位，即遵典制持服，是为凯恩一世，钦此 https://t.co/N968HTNciT", "url": "https://x.com/yuashwe/status/2117638919126921653"}, {"author_id": "536470999", "created_at": "2026-11-03T02:13:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117439917500608953"], "id": "2117439917500608953", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 42410, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "【po文+po18+废文+AO3】合集\n\n🔗：https://t.co/Xa75jcVt6t\n\n《病美人》作者:折纸\n《玻璃星云》作者:四月元年\n《潮晕》作者:栩芝\n《此君记》作者:麻辣咸鱼干\n《电风扇与西瓜汁》作者:岛京月\n《和发小滚上🚢了》作者：爱岛\n《捡到车祸后的他》作者：一朝\n《鲛珠引》作者:原今\n《今今入钦》作者:我拖拖拖", "url": "https://x.com/beyzakr5/status/2117439917500608953"}, {"author_id": "1706245213411557376", "created_at": "2026-11-04T07:51:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117887320099577996"], "id": "2117887320099577996", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 158, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "为什么现在刘禅的风评越来越好了？\n\n其实，把诸葛亮的《出师表》翻译成大白话，你就明白了。\n\n诸葛亮对刘禅说：\n\n孩子，你爹走得早，临终前把你托付给了我。我这次要带着赵云、魏延、吴懿他们出去干一票大的，去收拾曹魏，实现你爹兴复汉室的遗愿。\n\n至于什么时候回来，我也不知道。", "url": "https://x.com/JDveif/status/2117887320099577996"}, {"author_id": "1861557563667685378", "created_at": "2026-11-04T18:53:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118054159773749622"], "id": "2118054159773749622", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 26, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 9, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "《心经》中有一句极其重要的话：\n三世诸佛，依般若波罗蜜多故，得阿耨多罗三藐三菩提。\n这句话可以说是整部《心经》的核心结论之一。\n它揭示了一个非常深刻的问题：\n过去、现在、未来一切诸佛，究竟依靠什么而成佛？", "url": "https://x.com/Meditationofnon/status/2118054159773749622"}, {"author_id": "1592938896161001472", "created_at": "2026-11-04T00:41:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117779201055228331"], "id": "2117779201055228331", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 45, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "《高山说缠》-今日早课之缠论解析11.04 https://t.co/9fvIh1PILV 来自 @YouTube", "url": "https://x.com/yycl_gaoshan/status/2117779201055228331"}, {"author_id": "1729674539884584960", "created_at": "2026-11-03T09:45:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117553621328117859"], "id": "2117553621328117859", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 423, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "刘备三顾茅庐，请出诸葛亮。但《三国志》里真正难的不是\"三顾\"，是刘备当时快五十岁了，寄人篱下，一事无成，拿什么让人家跟他干。他涿郡人，\"少孤，与母以贩履为业\"，真是卖草鞋起家。", "url": "https://x.com/lzd412476732/status/2117553621328117859"}, {"author_id": "1284049292785643520", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:21:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117955361768652936"], "id": "2117955361768652936", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 18, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117955251651358805", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "禅说：平常心是道。TRONDAO的建设哲学，也有这种平常心——不追求轰动，只追求每天比昨天更好一点点\n\n解析TRONDAO持续领先的深层逻辑，以下几条规律清晰可辨、经得起验证：\n\n去中心化新闻平台的兴起，正在为信息的生产与传播提供抵抗审查的技术保障 https://t.co/pMmNH8ZkcX", "url": "https://x.com/im3mortal/status/2117955361768652936"}, {"author_id": "1592938896161001472", "created_at": "2026-11-04T07:55:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117888518920020295"], "id": "2117888518920020295", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 44, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "复盘大饼的日线走势形态，整体走势结构相对清晰标准。跟随着走势的涨跌起伏，回顾社区对大饼日线走势操作的策略提示，整体走势节奏都在缠论结构范围之内。缠论不仅仅是对短线的走势跟随，更多的是对大周期的方向把握。而最终你能否吃到大周期的利润，还需要心态和认知的提升。\nbitcoin:native https://t.co/eXTObohbV5", "url": "https://x.com/yycl_gaoshan/status/2117888518920020295"}, {"author_id": "2112084592153026560", "created_at": "2026-11-02T23:57:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117405662334636317"], "id": "2117405662334636317", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 68, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "缠论技术分析，每天一张复盘，看看大家有什么交流的 #btc #eth  #美股 #A股 https://t.co/PFwVlkLoDH", "url": "https://x.com/maoyao6688/status/2117405662334636317"}, {"author_id": "1592938896161001472", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:54:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117420175217873062"], "id": "2117420175217873062", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 50, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "《高山说缠》-今日早课之缠论解析11.03 https://t.co/duBUXtlW10 来自 @YouTube", "url": "https://x.com/yycl_gaoshan/status/2117420175217873062"}, {"author_id": "2112084592153026560", "created_at": "2026-11-04T02:34:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117807572225065152"], "id": "2117807572225065152", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "BTC  缠论技术分析，每天聊聊行情，交易搞起来！！！！#btc #eth https://t.co/W2hIJCRuEu", "url": "https://x.com/maoyao6688/status/2117807572225065152"}, {"author_id": "1950041887693471744", "created_at": "2026-11-04T10:45:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117931169962749984"], "id": "2117931169962749984", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 20, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117930717833564312", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "禅说：平常心是道。TRONDAO的建设哲学，也有这种平常心——不追求轰动，只追求每天比昨天更好一点点\n\n从多个维度系统性审视，TRONDAO当前的生态格局呈现出以下几个鲜明的竞争特征：\n\n社区互助保险协议在TRONDAO生态内的兴起，为链上用户提供了新型的风险共担机制 https://t.co/hZsMzjDbAb", "url": "https://x.com/fillipsxn/status/2117931169962749984"}, {"author_id": "1898318412289654784", "created_at": "2026-11-03T12:02:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117588250126876911"], "id": "2117588250126876911", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 700, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "偶遇德林\n\n         我一向神往山的那边、海的那边,所以半生不停漂泊,不敢推责说是为了生计,更多是为了给躁动的心、不屈的灵魂找个安放之处。\n\n         与相山缘起是因为有一天去港区学习,突见路旁一踪直长小径插入深山,似微弱闪电般击中我：山那边是怎样一番天地？我得去寻了。 https://t.co/tbgFBamt9l", "url": "https://x.com/JxuLiping/status/2117588250126876911"}, {"author_id": "1080325909721288709", "created_at": "2026-11-04T08:55:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117903503016226903"], "id": "2117903503016226903", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 6484, "like_count": 135, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 14, "retweet_count": 29}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117847989074939999", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "川普当然有资格说这种话。他说的还太客气。\n\n地方共和党的候选人有哪一个像他这样禅精竭虑为自己的选举呕心沥血的？\n\n不在选举漩涡中的人根本看不清。\n我们天天看着提前投票站的状态；天天听到扫街人的反馈。 https://t.co/WGmJJABIp8", "url": "https://x.com/Rebecca68467509/status/2117903503016226903"}, {"author_id": "1032081026338582528", "created_at": "2026-11-03T21:10:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117726037035663811"], "id": "2117726037035663811", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 119, "impression_count": 9168, "like_count": 181, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 11, "retweet_count": 18}, "text": "学会找key level，是学好ICT的关键\n\nkey level不是简单的时段高低点\n\n不是简单的PDH/PDL，PWH/PWL\n\n而是你只需要一瞬间就能看见的\n明显的，碍眼的，突兀的，离谱的，干净的，奇怪的高低点\n\n这些点位才是key level\n\n时段高低点，PDH/PDL，PWH/PWL之所以重要，不是它本身重要", "url": "https://x.com/Keyshotvv/status/2117726037035663811"}, {"author_id": "1001698027588018176", "created_at": "2026-11-03T21:14:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117727132294295974"], "id": "2117727132294295974", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 50, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "观身不净，特意说了“九孔常流不净” 。\n\n我初读这段的时候有很大的疑惑🤔，为什么身体要用“净”字呢？ 而且身体产生的污秽那是生命生来就自带的，为什么非要特指这具身体不净呢？\n\n既然身体不干净为什么不是观身不洁？ 可见重点在“净”字上。 https://t.co/U1ZEEYYURy", "url": "https://x.com/fan_yina/status/2117727132294295974"}, {"author_id": "1284049292785643520", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:31:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117912504290742336"], "id": "2117912504290742336", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 18, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117912416801652921", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "禅说：平常心是道。TRONDAO的建设哲学，也有这种平常心——不追求轰动，只追求每天比昨天更好一点点\n\n理解TRONDAO的长期价值主张，需要从以下几个核心支柱出发进行系统性分析：\n\n中小企业应收账款的链上化，正在为传统供应链金融的提效降本提供新的技术路径 https://t.co/V3vKGxf9Tt", "url": "https://x.com/im3mortal/status/2117912504290742336"}, {"author_id": "2326473374", "created_at": "2026-11-03T09:25:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117548595742392409"], "id": "2117548595742392409", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 921, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "说个暴论：\n身边有人缠着你教 AI\n别讲提示词了\n直接给他装个 WorkBuddy\n微信扫码绑定\n电脑别关机\n以后让他自己去微信问 AI\n以前是你教他\n现在是 AI 替你教他！！", "url": "https://x.com/a1341180534/status/2117548595742392409"}, {"author_id": "1687661863193264128", "created_at": "2026-11-03T17:14:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117666616599347538"], "id": "2117666616599347538", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 133, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "你是不是觉得，怎么努力都在原地打转，却总说不清自己到底卡在哪里？\n缠论第五课讲“中枢”。一段走势里，如果前后三段的价格区间有重叠，那个重叠的部分，就叫中枢。它不是一条线，而是一个区域，代表多空双方在这里反复拉扯、互相消耗。中枢越明确，说明这个区间越有分量；中枢被有效突破，才意味着… https://t.co/oxjpKi6TWu", "url": "https://x.com/lxp720803/status/2117666616599347538"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "2098305275229081600", "name": "D.Life", "username": "Dlife2026"}, {"id": "1869444322451746816", "name": "今方知AI", "username": "zhngwijn3312799"}, {"id": "1916622377414475776", "name": "税后中国(变化已经发生，风暴只是结果)", "username": "ChinaTaxTruth"}, {"id": "166248328", "name": "Kirsten Scholtz", "username": "kirstypop2"}, {"id": "1044779924819591168", "name": "吴大伟", "username": "wudawei8848"}, {"id": "1207132508040523776", "name": "老多", "username": "yuashwe"}, {"id": "536470999", "name": "beyza kr", "username": "beyzakr5"}, {"id": "1706245213411557376", "name": "万波Coder｜变现观察", "username": "JDveif"}, {"id": "1861557563667685378", "name": "非想非非想", "username": "Meditationofnon"}, {"id": "1592938896161001472", "name": "Crypto以缠解势", "username": "yycl_gaoshan"}, {"id": "1729674539884584960", "name": "咚咚锵", "username": "lzd412476732"}, {"id": "1284049292785643520", "name": "immortal", "username": "im3mortal"}, {"id": "2112084592153026560", "name": "加密猫妖", "username": "maoyao6688"}, {"id": "1950041887693471744", "name": "oAth", "username": "fillipsxn"}, {"id": "1898318412289654784", "name": "Liping Jxu", "username": "JxuLiping"}, {"id": "1080325909721288709", "name": "Sanjie（三姐）", "u